    <title>Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Adaptive Prompt Search</title>
    <summary>
      We present a new method for automatically discovering jailbreak prompts
      against aligned LLMs, using an adaptive search over a learned prompt
      embedding space. Our method achieves higher attack success rates than
      prior black-box approaches across five model families.
    </summary>
