    <title>Zero-Shot Forecasting with Time Series Foundation Models: A Benchmark</title>
    <summary>
      We introduce a benchmark for evaluating zero-shot forecasting
      performance of time series foundation models across 40 domains,
      covering long-horizon and irregularly sampled series.
    </summary>
